"""ARCH-43 — Universal Packet Dicer & Case Intelligence.
One atomic, idempotent apply for the whole milestone (backend, console, verifiers, deploy, docs).

Run from backend/:

    python apply_arch43.py --check      # report every file, write nothing
    python apply_arch43.py              # apply
    python apply_arch43.py              # again: every line reads "already applied"
    python apply_arch43.py --rollback   # restore what the last apply replaced
    python apply_arch43.py --list       # the files this script owns

Accepted starting point: 96f4dd0 ("ARCH 42 DONE"). A file already carrying a
later milestone's sentinel (ARCH44-S1: and on) is reported as superseded.

ARCH43-S1:apply. GENERATED from `git diff 96f4dd0` plus the new files
(42 new, 47 edited through 104 anchors); the generator refuses to
emit if any file carries no ARCH43-S sentinel, and every edit is an anchor that
occurs exactly once when it applies, checked against the final sha256.
"""

